    "wikipedia_summary": "<i><b>Fontanesia</b></i> is a genus of flowering plants in the family Oleaceae, usually treated as comprising a single species <i><b>Fontanesia phillyreoides</b></i>, though some authors split this into two species (see below). It is native to southern Europe (Sicily), southwestern Asia (Lebanon, Syria, Turkey) and eastern Asia (China), with two well-separated populations.",
